# PHP Rules

- Framework: custom MVC (PHP 7.4) — no Laravel/Symfony conventions
- Namespaces: `Core\`, `Database\`, `Http\`, `Routing\`, `View\`, `Menu\`
- Classes: PascalCase / Methods & variables: camelCase / Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- DB tables use `nb_` prefix (e.g. `nb_siteinfo`, `nb_admin`)
- DB schema changes must go through migration files (`make m`), never alter tables directly

## Patterns

```php
// Routing
$router->get('/', function () {
    return render('pages.index');
})->name('home');

// View rendering
render('pages.index');                        // views/pages/index.php
render('pages.works.view', ['no' => $no]);    // views/pages/works/view.php
```

## Image Upload & WEBP Optimization

All Admin image uploads flow through `imageUpload()` in `inc/lib/func.php`.
After saving, it automatically calls `\Core\ImageProcessor::makeWebpSibling()`.

```php
// Standard upload call — WEBP sibling is created automatically
$result = imageUpload($UPLOAD_DIR_CLIENTS, $_FILES['thumb_image']);
$saved = $result['saved'];   // e.g. "6830abc.png" — DB stores this, foo.webp created alongside

// If you add a NEW upload path that bypasses imageUpload(), call manually:
move_uploaded_file($tmp, "$dir/$filename");
\Core\ImageProcessor::makeWebpSibling("$dir/$filename");

// Deletion — imageDelete() handles sibling cleanup automatically
imageDelete("$UPLOAD_DIR_CLIENTS/$saved");  // removes .png + .webp
```

Rules:
- Do not add image resize/convert logic outside `Core\ImageProcessor`.
- `makeWebpSibling()` is silent on failure — never throw from it.
- Convertible: `jpg`, `jpeg`, `png`, `gif`. Skipped: `svg`, `ico`.
- Max width: 2560px (auto-resize). Quality: 82.

## Image Rendering

모든 업로드 이미지 출력은 `render_uploaded_image()` (`config/functions.php`) 경유 필수.
업로드 경로에 `<img>` 단독 태그 직접 사용 금지.

```php
// 히어로 (above-the-fold — LCP)
<?= render_uploaded_image((string) ($work['thumbnailImage'] ?? ''), $title, '', 'eager') ?>

// 그리드/목록 (below-the-fold)
<?= render_uploaded_image((string) ($work['thumbnailImage'] ?? ''), $workLabel, '', 'lazy') ?>
```

Rules:
- 첫 번째 인자는 **raw 미이스케이프** URL. 헬퍼가 내부에서 escape 처리.
- `$thumbnailImage = e(...)` 로 이미 escape된 변수를 넘기면 이중 escape 발생 — raw 소스 배열에서 꺼낼 것.
- SVG/ICO는 `<picture>` 없이 plain `<img>` 출력.
- `class`는 `<img>` 요소에 적용. `<picture>` 자체에 class가 필요하면 외부에서 감싸기.
- 기존 파일 backfill: `php scripts/backfill-webp.php`
